<view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view class="page"><view class="row"><view class="brand">我的预约</view><text class="link" bindtap="refresh">刷新状态</text></view><view class="sub">到店时出示完整购买码，请勿转发给他人。</view><view class="ticket" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id"><view class="ticket-head"><view class="title">{{item.status==='redeemed'?'已到店核销':'预约成功，如约相见'}}</view><view class="sub">{{item.event_name}}</view></view><view class="ticket-body"><view class="number">#{{item.numberText}}</view><view class="note">你的入场号码</view><view class="code" data-code="{{item.code}}" bindtap="copy"><view>{{item.codeTop}}</view><view>{{item.codeBottom}}</view><view class="muted">20 位唯一购买码 · 点击复制</view></view><view class="detail"><text>预约场次</text><text>{{item.slot_label}}</text></view><view class="detail"><text>入场时间</text><text>{{item.timeText}}</text></view><view class="detail"><text>到店地点</text><text>{{item.location}}</text></view><view class="detail"><text>预约手机号</text><text>{{item.phoneText}}</text></view><view class="detail"><text>购买码状态</text><text>{{item.status==='redeemed'?'已核销':'待核销'}}</text></view></view></view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{loaded &amp;&amp; !items.length}}"><view class="empty-title">期待与你相遇</view><view>还没有预约，去看看门店的下一场活动。</view></view><button class="primary" bindtap="home">浏览门店活动</button><view class="note">购买码仅限本人使用，到店请出示完整码。</view></view>
